Build against the system's libzint (zint-devel) instead of the copy in
external/zint; no vcpkg checkout and no pip install at configure time
(network), so no type stub generation (pybind11-stubgen is not in Fedora);
no -Werror; the build-system pins relaxed to what Fedora ships
(scikit-build-core 0.11, pybind11 3.0.x, CMake 4).
generate-enums.py takes the header to read as its argument.
Not sent upstream yet (bindreams/zint-bindings).

